-# An item as a mini entity card: the mockup's miniCard() (00-shared.js:173).
-# Orange frame, because an item is orange in this design language.
-#
-# `item` may be nil — a purchase whose Item was hard deleted. Soft delete (D1)
-# will make that impossible; until then the fallback glyph stands in.
%span.gh-card.gh-mc
  %span.gh-card-f
    %span.gh-card-i
      - if item&.image&.attached?
        = image_tag item.image, alt: ''
      - else
        %i.fa-solid.fa-flask{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
